      "content": "rhabdomyolysis?? that sounds terrifying, i've never even heard of that. i'm definitely getting a bit more anxious now which i guess isn't helping. but honestly, the idea of an ER visit is what's making me feel physically ill. if i really, really want to avoid the hospital, is there like anything i can take right now to just help the muscle pain and maybe detox my system? like maybe some high doses of vitamin c or some ibuprofen so i can just sleep through it? i feel like if i can just get the pain under control, everything will be fine by tomorrow.",
